\]

Optical depth:
\[
d\tau_\nu = \kappa_\nu ds.
\]

Solution:
\[
I_\nu(\tau_\nu) = I_\nu(0)e^{-\tau_\nu}
+ \int_0^{\tau_\nu} S_\nu(t) e^{-(\tau_\nu - t)} dt.
\]

